A name clash and a module file error.
--- project.yaml
modules: [a/x, b/x, c]
--- a/x/module.yaml
product: jvm/lib
--- b/x/module.yaml
product: jvm/lib
--- c/module.yaml
product: jvm/foo
--- expected
c/module.yaml:1:10: ERROR: Unknown value `jvm/foo`. Expected one of: [`lib`, `jvm/app`, `jvm/lib`, `kmp/lib`, `jvm/amper-plugin`, `android/app`, `ios/app`, `macos/app`, `linux/app`, `windows/app`, `wasm-js/app`, `wasm-wasi/app`, `js/app`]
